---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Reports | Who Is Abebe?">

  <Header>
    <Fragment slot="title">Reports</Fragment>

    <Fragment slot="subtitle">
      Longform public records reviews and development research.
    </Fragment>
  </Header>

  <main class="article-wrap">
    <article class="article-body">

      <p class="lede">
        Reports collect the archive into focused research files. Each page
        separates verified records, observations, images, tables, and open questions.
      </p>

      <div class="section-grid">

        <a class="section-card feature-card" href="/reports/st-george-crossing">
          <span>Research File No. 001</span>
          <h3>St. George Crossing</h3>
          <p>
            A structured review of public records, project materials,
            municipal documents, renderings, local reporting, and related entities.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a class="section-card" href="/reports/mike-abebe">
          <span>Research File No. 002</span>
          <h3>Mike Abebe & Abebe Ventures</h3>
          <p>
            A central dossier connecting images, Abebe Ventures, project claims,
            249 Milton Ave SE, related LLCs, and Waynesboro property references.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a class="section-card" href="/reports/direct-invest-group">
          <span>Research File No. 003</span>
          <h3>Direct Invest Group</h3>
          <p>
            A source-code and Wayback Machine trail connecting archived Direct Invest
            material to Mike Abebe, Carlton Brown, and related development records.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a class="section-card" href="/reports/elysian-development-group">
          <span>Research File No. 004</span>
          <h3>Elysian Development Group</h3>
          <p>
            A captured web-material review focused on Elysian advisor references,
            Carlton Brown, Mike Abebe, and St. George Crossing project material.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a class="section-card" href="/reports/ensley-rising">
          <span>Research File No. 005</span>
          <h3>Ensley Rising</h3>
          <p>
            A public-records review of archived Ensley Rising material,
            Ramsay-McCormack reporting, Carlton Brown, Gizman Abbas,
            and Abebe Blackbelt Ventures.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a class="section-card" href="/reports/epa-sewer-grant">
          <span>Research File No. 006</span>
          <h3>EPA Sewer Grant</h3>
          <p>
            A focused review of EPA grant 03D02024, Waynesboro sewer work,
            project signage, and resident concerns reported locally.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a class="section-card" href="/reports/waynesboro-infrastructure-agreement">
          <span>Research File No. 007 · Dossier 2.0 · New October 2026</span>
          <h3>Waynesboro Infrastructure Agreement</h3>
          <p>
            The June 15, 2026 agreement between the City of Waynesboro and
            Abebe Ventures, LLC: the amounts, the terms, the vote, and open questions.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a class="section-card" href="/reports/records-to-request">
          <span>Research File No. 008 · Dossier 2.0 · New October 2026</span>
          <h3>Records to Request</h3>
          <p>
            Ten sets of public records, by office, that would answer open
            questions in the reports.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a class="section-card" href="/reports/company-name-change">
          <span>Research File No. 009 · Dossier 2.0 · New October 2026</span>
          <h3>A Company Number, Two Names</h3>
          <p>
            Georgia control number 24062142 as the site first listed it and as a registry mirror lists it now, with what each side has said and the records that would settle it.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a class="section-card" href="/reports/companies">
          <span>Research File No. 010 · Dossier 2.0 · New October 2026</span>
          <h3>Companies</h3>
          <p>
            The Georgia and other-state entities the sources tie to the developer, with registry-mirror dates and the federal small-business loan records.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a class="section-card" href="/reports/court-and-notice-records">
          <span>Research File No. 011 · Dossier 2.0 · New October 2026</span>
          <h3>Court and Notice Records</h3>
          <p>
            A wage suit settled with liability denied, an appeal that was remanded, published tax notices and city code-complaint records, with what was not read.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a class="section-card" href="/reports/planning-and-votes">
          <span>Research File No. 012 · Dossier 2.0 · New October 2026</span>
          <h3>Planning and Votes</h3>
          <p>
            Dated Waynesboro and Atlanta planning, council and committee actions on St. George Crossing and the Sylvan Road rezoning, as the records state them.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a class="section-card" href="/reports/fulton-court-order">
          <span>Research File No. 013 · Dossier 2.0 · New October 2026</span>
          <h3>The Fulton County Court Order</h3>
          <p>
            A May 2026 order in Abebe Caesar Ventures, LLC v. Mekonnen Abebe:
            what the court ordered, what each side told it, and what is still open.
          </p>
        </a>

      </div>

    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />

</BaseLayout>
